s://github.com/Mohamed-Mabrouki\"><code>@​Mohamed-Mabrouki</code></a> made their first contribution in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/MohamedRejeb/Calf/pull/298\">MohamedRejeb/Calf#298</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Full Changelog</strong>: <a href=\"https://github.com/MohamedRejeb/Calf/compare/v0.7.1...v0.8.0\">https://github.com/MohamedRejeb/Calf/compare/v0.7.1...v0.8.0</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/MohamedRejeb/Calf/commit/55e2199c60290085c63b9041b0f2fb1f226ed92b\"><code>55e2199</code></a> Merge pull request <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/MohamedRejeb/Calf/issues/301\">#301</a> from MohamedRejeb/0.7.x</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/MohamedRejeb/Calf/commit/3421d15d9bb31a8e955b0387aca90d51acc73a81\"><code>3421d15</code></a> Update version to 0.8.0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/MohamedRejeb/Calf/commit/8a6f87d00e64226365f54b17a8698a46f009768b\"><code>8a6f87d</code></a> Merge pull request <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/MohamedRejeb/Calf/issues/300\">#300</a> from MohamedRejeb/0.7.x</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/MohamedRejeb/Calf/commit/5dfd8e0ec0153b0233a1ed18c59b393f4ba67787\"><code>5dfd8e0</code></a> Publish wasm yarn lock</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/MohamedRejeb/Calf/commit/c2ae3574d310a0f3063c8f5ee041186890156896\"><code>c2ae357</code></a> Merge remote-tracking branch 'origin/main' into 0.7.x</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/MohamedRejeb/Calf/commit/f44b695725325543776dac46d89660a504b231ff\"><code>f44b695</code></a> Fix ios permission show rational state</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/MohamedRejeb/Calf/commit/c9725040c1d8dc776810fd903bb684057304886b\"><code>c972504</code></a> Merge pull request <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/MohamedRejeb/Calf/issues/291\">#291</a> from MohamedRejeb/dependabot/gradle/coil-3.2.0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/MohamedRejeb/Calf/commit/37d58f4aea3f6282afbe117922337f98